sheet[0] | 54, 54, 16, 16 | Ordinary wall, set 1 of 2. The game loads this cell, but never draws it as a join. A tile with no connections uses the row of lone tiles instead. This is also the inside corner, drawn where two connected sides meet and the tile between them isn't part of the wall. As painted it's the north-east corner, and the game turns it for the other three.
